S132 LRC14 FAREY GRAPH / PZ CARRIER SYNTHESIS
==============================================================================
[Assumption challenge]
  considered vertices: runners, Farey fractions, fraction payloads,
    residual masks, K4 edges, half-cube cuts, sector-empty events, and
    proof obligations.
  chosen quotient: a role tournament on proof carriers, backed by exact
    graph and sequence fingerprints.
  preserved predicate: which carrier keeps the data needed for the
    LRC14 binding-scale / state-lift proof target.
  destroyed predicate: raw row-specific witnesses; those remain in
    HYP-2930/HYP-2931 and the exact-period packet ledgers.

[1] Unit-excess Farey child chain
  p/q = p/(14p-1); q moves by +14, matching the apex-14 n+2 lane.
